title: "Quintessence"
abstract: "Three-layer formal verification suite for Elixir/OTP/BEAM: sequential pure subsets with TINI + MPR R5 non-interference, choreographic K-CUT GenServer protocols, and Idris2 QTT ABI + verified Zig NIFs under MaxPlus 1 ms scheduler bounds, backed by Z3, CVC5, Alethe proof checking, and ECHIDNA mutation gates."
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-22"
url: "https://github.com/hyperpolymath/quintessence"
